{
  "name" : "Gulbudak2019.2 - Heterogeneous viral strategies promote coexistence in virus-microbe systems (Chronic)",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a mathematical model describing describing the population dynamics of microbes infected by chronically infecting viruses.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
    "name" : "SBML",
